[en.FOCUS_C15_ORDINARY_PONIES_WILL]
Ponies’ Will

[en.FOCUS_C15_ORDINARY_PONIES_WILL_desc]
To change the current situation of the Crystal Empire, it is necessary to use the power of the ordinary crystal ponies. Let the crystal ponies realize their own power and let every crystal pony actively participate in the affairs of the Empire.

